title: Case Manager › Reviews this week › The review drawer
route: /manager?tab=reviews (drawer over the list)
intro: It also opens from the quick view's 'Open review' button, on top of the quick view (Escape closes one layer at a time). Opening a review shows the draft an agent wrote, the four Integrity checks and the buttons to sign or open the case. What the clinician can do depends on the review's status: a clean draft, a draft with one check to look at, a review that needs an update, or one already signed.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click the case ID or 'Open' on a review row"
overlay o1 "Drawer slides in from the right (640 px)\nTitle 'R-0856 · Summit'\nSubtitle 'Continued-stay review 2 · Residential 3.5 · due Tue 10/20, 9:00 am'\nStatus pill at the top right"
screen b1 "Top of the body\n'J.S., 51 · privacy mode'   'Drafted by' Scribe (Residential, Detox) or Cadence (PHP, IOP)\nOnce drafted: 'Draft by FLO's agents. A clinician reviews and signs before anything is sent.'"
screen b2 "'The draft'\nLarge text box with seven parts: title and payer lines, Clinical status, Treatment progress, Risk and safety, Why this level of care still fits, Request"
screen b3 "'Integrity checks'\n'Every sentence traced to the chart'\n'Review has no errors'\n'All payer requirements covered'\n'Level of care matches the request'"
screen b4 "Footer\n'Sign review' (green), 'Open case', 'Close'"

decision d1 "What is the review's status?"
process t1 "'Drafted', all four checks green ticks\nDraft can be edited\nBanner: 'Signing is one review at a time. Your edits to the draft are saved with the signature.'"
process t2 "'Drafted' with 'Check to look at'\nOne check is amber with Integrity's note, for example 'The draft asks for 7 days. Beacon's usual limit at this level of care is 5.'\nDraft can be edited"
process t3 "'Needs your update'\nAmber panel names what is missing; 'All payer requirements covered' is red\nDraft is locked: 'The draft is locked until your update is added.'\n'Sign review' is greyed, hover text 'Add your update first'"
process t4 "'Signed'\nDraft is read-only\nFooter shows 'Signed by Heather K., LISW-S' in place of the button\nGreen banner 'Next review: Tue 10/27, 9:00 am' with 'Cadence booked it.' and either 'It is on this week's list.' or 'It falls after this week, so it is not on the list yet.'"
process t5 "'Not drafted yet'\nGrey panel 'Not drafted yet': 'Cadence drafts each review a few days ahead. This one is not due until Sat 10/24, 9:00 am, so it has no draft and no Integrity checks yet.'\nThe line above reads 'To be drafted by' Cadence\nNo draft box and no checks\n'Sign review' is greyed, hover text 'Draft the review first'"
click c4 "Click 'Draft this review'"
decision dp "Is Cadence paused in Settings?"
toast tp "'Cadence is paused in Settings'\n'It drafts no reviews until you resume it there.'"
process pd "Button shows a spinner for about 1.3 seconds"
store sd "Review becomes 'Drafted': the seven-part text and four green Integrity checks appear"
toast td "'Cadence drafted 1 review'"

input i1 "Edit the draft text"
click c1 "Click 'Sign review'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Case Manager › Reviews this week › Sign a review"
goto g2 "Continues in: Case Manager › Reviews this week › Add your update to a review"

click c2 "Click 'Open case'"
process p1 "Go to /authorizations/case/ and the case ID, with ?tab=draft\nThe drawer is gone with the page"
decision d3 "Is the case a request in the queue or on the Dashboard?"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case › Draft tab"
goto g4 "Continues in: Case Manager › Ledger case › Open and read"

click c3 "Click 'Close', the X, the dimmed area, or press Escape\n(Escape closes one layer at a time: an open sign dialog or filter menu first, the drawer next)"
decision d2 "Was the review a draft?"
store st1 "Edits to the draft are saved on the review\nOpen it again and the edited text is there"
process p2 "Nothing to save"
end e1 "Back on the list, same place"

s1 --> o1 --> b1 --> b2 --> b3 --> b4 --> d1
d1 -->|Clean draft| t1
d1 -->|One check to look at| t2
d1 -->|Missing item| t3
d1 -->|Already signed| t4
d1 -->|No draft yet| t5
t1 --> i1
t2 --> i1
t1 --> c1 --> g1
t2 --> c1
t3 --> g2
t4 --> c2
t1 --> c2
c2 --> p1 --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| g3
d3 -->|No: only the ledger has it| g4
t5 --> c4 --> dp
dp -->|Yes| tp
dp -->|No| pd --> sd --> td --> t1
b4 --> c3 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes: Drafted| st1 --> e1
d2 -->|No| p2 --> e1
